1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
This is the multi-agent team plugin for DeepSeek Harness.
These are real interface screenshots with example data.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Save a reusable team with three roles:
product planning, implementation, and quality review.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Choose a team beside the composer. Use Team, Solo,
or the project default, with an optional one-message override.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Run Center shows the execution plan, dependencies, and member states.
This example proceeds through planning, implementation, and review.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Review and repair records show the rounds and their owners.
The two rounds shown here are preset example data.

6
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Token Insights separates planning, member execution, review, and repair.
The displayed figures illustrate the interface, not measured performance.

7
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Recipes make team configurations reusable. Before importing,
preview conflicts and map missing model routes.

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Find the source and installation instructions on GitHub.
If this is useful, consider giving the project a Star.
